# User data sources: ignore UPLOADED dynamic sources, but keep the SEEDED
# reference corpora -- the seed scripts (backend/bundle/seed_*.py) read these
# files to verify evidence spans at build time, so they MUST be in git or the
# seed + its tests fail on a clean checkout (this exact bug broke CI: higgsfield
# was seeded but its sources were ignored, so 18 tests hit FileNotFoundError on
# a fresh clone). Every seeded corpus needs a matching un-ignore below.
data/sources/*/
!data/sources/rivanly-inc/
!data/sources/higgsfield/

# Local documents & drafts (untracked on GitHub)
brand_alchemy_company_brain.html
company_brain_PRD_v4.md

# Claude Code session files (never commit these)
session-ses*.md

# Windows artifacts
nul
backend/nul

# Logs
backend_log.txt
*.log


backend.env

# Rust build artifacts (edge-evaluator)
/edge-evaluator/target/
